h0M12574 5201h0M12582 5313h0M12949 1347h0M12971 1242h0M13015 1059h0M12954 1083h0M12577 1419h0M12654 1408h0M12874 1192h0M11924 1823h0M18464 4874h0M19119 4624h0M18649 5527h0M6264 3376h0M6965 3761h0M7073 3840h0M7239 3762h0M7387 3898h0M7808 4236h0M8148 3441h0M7430 3075h0M7246 1660h0M7178 1510h0M6064 1862h0M1034 6767h0M1535 8233h0M19378 7831h0M13634 1222h0M14132 950h0M14132 950h0M13210 953h0M13406 760h0M13574 785h0M13831 749h0M13790 781h0M13650 893h0M13565 976h0M16906 2722h0M17212 2740h0M16310 2653h0M15970 2281h0M18391 3242h0M18602 4082h0M18481 4017h0M17783 3344h0M10973 4526h0M10701 3759h0M10678 4461h0"/></svg><figcaption><span class="map-key"><i class="k-p"></i>Profile</span><span class="map-key"><i class="k-s"></i>State</span><span>331 states with a known seat in 1957</span><a href="/atlas?year=1957">Open the atlas at 1957 &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure>
<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/soviet-union"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Soviet%20Union.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Soviet Union</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Sputnik 1, the first artificial satellite, is launched</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/civil-rights-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Civil%20rights%20movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Civil rights movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Federal troops escort nine Black students into Central High School in Little Rock, Arkansas</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/government/elective-monarchy"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Elective%20monarchy.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Elective monarchy</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Malaya’s Conference of Rulers elects the first Yang di-Pertuan Agong for a five-year term</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/federal-republic-of-germany"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Federal%20Republic%20of%20Germany.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Federal Republic of Germany</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 1 January the Saarland joins West Germany.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-morocco"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Morocco.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Morocco</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Sultan Mohammed V, restored from exile in 1955 and sovereign of an independent Morocco since March 1956, takes the title of King.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-haiti"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Haiti.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Haiti</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">François 'Papa Doc' Duvalier is elected president; he rules by terror until his death in 1971 and is followed by his son until 1986.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/gold-coast-colony"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Gold%20Coast%20Colony.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Gold Coast Colony</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 6 March the Colony of the Gold Coast becomes independent as Ghana.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/kwame-nkrumah"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kwame%20Nkrumah.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kwame Nkrumah</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Gold Coast becomes independent as Ghana, with Nkrumah as prime minister</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/malacca"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Malacca.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Malacca</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Malaya becomes independent on 31 August</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/kumasi"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kumasi.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kumasi</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Ghana becomes independent and Kumasi becomes the capital of the Ashanti Region</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/martin-luther-king-jr"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Martin%20Luther%20King%20Jr..png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Martin Luther King Jr.</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Helps found the Southern Christian Leadership Conference and becomes its first president</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/gandhism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Gandhism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Gandhism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A committee to promote Gandhi's teaching is formed, and the Gandhi Peace Foundation begins publishing Gandhi Marg</span></li></ul></section>
